'''Bloodvelds''' are [[demon|demons]] known for attacking victims with their long tongues, which have magical properties allowing them to pierce through physical defences.{{CiteNPC|npc=Slayer Master|quote=Bloodveld are strange demonic creatures, their long rasping tongue has magical properties so it pierces straight through physical defences. |loc=|notes=|name=}} They are [[Slayer monsters]] requiring level 50 [[Slayer]] to kill.

While assigned a bloodveld Slayer task, players with the [[Slayer Rewards|Bigger and Badder]] perk unlocked have a 1 in 200 chance for an [[Insatiable Bloodveld|insatiable bloodveld]] to appear after each kill. However, bloodvelds in the [[God Wars Dungeon]] and [[Wilderness God Wars Dungeon]] do not spawn superiors.

As [[demon (attribute)|demons]], bloodvelds are susceptible to [[demonbane weapons|demonbane weaponry]].

