==Trivia==
*Bloodvelds have a similar drop table to that of [[lesser demon]]s.
*Bloodvelds had a festive override wearing a [[Santa hat]] during the [[2023 Christmas event/Gallery|2023]], [[2024 Christmas event/Gallery|2024]], and [[2025 Christmas event/Gallery|2025]] Christmas event.
*All bloodvelds have some requirement to kill them. The ones in the [[God Wars Dungeon]] require 60 [[Strength]] or [[Agility]], the ones in the [[Stronghold Slayer Cave]] require a [[Slayer task]], and the ones in [[Morytania]] require [[Priest in Peril]]. However, [[Mutated Bloodveld|mutated bloodveld]]s can be killed without a requirement.

